  Breaks and inline
  ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  A hard break follows this line
  and this one continues after a backslash
  then the paragraph ends. Struck text, https://example.com/autolink, a titled link, and math left
  as written: $E = mc^2$. Escaped *asterisks* and an inline <kbd>html</kbd> tag stay readable.

  An inline image 󰥶 alt text sits in a sentence.

